234375], "pos": [521.129638671875, -2537.923828125], "widgets_values": ["电影感女性肖像，肩膀以上特写，极简奢华美学。穿着结构感黑色高领，锁骨处点缀细金链。表情冷淡疏离，眼神略偏离镜头。单侧伦勃朗光营造深邃阴影，中性暗调背景带微妙纹理。高级时装编辑风格，8K超清聚焦面料质感与肌肤， muted色系以黑、奶油白与金色点缀，Vogue封面构图。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 32, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [52], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [500.3509216308594, 189.29598999023438], "pos": [503.7345275878906, -2229.044921875], "widgets_values": ["高端时尚肖像，肩膀以上裁切，禁欲克制氛围。模特身着挺括白色 oversized 衬衫，锋利领型，顶扣微敞露出锁骨线条。表情难以捉摸，唇线轻抿，目光直视却毫无情绪。冷色调色温，苍白蓝白光线，近乎临床感的氛围。纯净白色背景带柔和渐变。锐利对焦，高对比度，瓷质肌肤纹理，奢华极简主义，Harper's Bazaar美学，对称构图，负空间布局。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 33, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 8}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-1137.6226200420583, 2193.6454329856106], "scale": 0.9646149645000127}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 60, "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 2, "title": "不需要那么多时，记得关掉左边的提示词", "bounding": [1217.1981201171875, -2403.474853515625, 1119.71337890625, 81.9481201171875]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 60, "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 3, "title": "按需要 Ctrl+B 开启/关闭 下面提示词组", "bounding": [303.26953125, -2764.568115234375, 1119.71337890625, 81.9481201171875]}], "links": [[51, 32, 0, 30, 1, "STRING"], [52, 33, 0, 30, 3, "STRING"], [53, 34, 0, 30, 5, "STRING"], [54, 35, 0, 30, 7, "STRING"], [55, 36, 0, 30, 9, "STRING"], [56, 37, 0, 30, 11, "STRING"], [57, 38, 0, 30, 13, "STRING"], [58, 39, 0, 30, 15, "STRING"], [59, 30, 1, 31, 0, "IMAGE"], [60, 30, 2, 40, 0, "IMAGE"]